From c04d111c0ea46f212a1417b2ba9a2305f426e738 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 01:02:10 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(scratch): keep cache/scratch and cache/uv out of
 Spotlight via *.noindex dirs on macOS [daveey]

A home-rooted TMPDIR made every pytest tmp dir, uv build and review worktree Spotlight work
(340K indexed items under cache/scratch, ~1 core of mds/mdworker). On darwin the real dirs now
live at cache/scratch.noindex and cache/uv.noindex with cache/scratch and cache/uv as relative
symlinks, so every existing path keeps working. Existing dirs migrate by one atomic rename.
HERMES_SPOTLIGHT_INDEX_CACHE=1 opts out.
---
